graph TD
    subgraph ClientDevice [User's Mobile Device / Edge Node]
        direction TB
        UI[User Input: Camera & Dietary Goals]
        Pre[Data Processing: Image Scaling]
        LocalModel[Local Edge AI Model: YOLOv8]
        NutriDB[(Local Nutritional Database)]
        LocalTraining[On-Device Federated Training]
        Encrypt[Gradient Encryption Module]
    end

    subgraph BackendServer [Cloud Aggregation Server]
        direction TB
        Aggregator[Federated Aggregation Engine: FedAvg]
        GlobalModel[(Global Model Weights)]
    end

    UI -->|Captured Image| Pre
    Pre -->|Processed Image| LocalModel
    LocalModel -->|Predicted Food Classes| NutriDB
    NutriDB -->|Caloric & Macro Data| UI
    
    Pre -.->|Local Data for Retraining| LocalTraining
    LocalTraining -->|Computed Local Gradients| Encrypt
    Encrypt == "Secure Encrypted Payload" ==> Aggregator
    Aggregator --> GlobalModel
    GlobalModel == "Updated Global Weights" ==> LocalModel

    classDef default fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef secure fill:#f0f0f0,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    class Encrypt,Aggregator,GlobalModel secure;
